WEBVTT

NOTE Lines from S01E01C03; times read from each take's sound levels (not heard). Off by default.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.000
Your clock. The one that times the character.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:39.500
I want to know how often it needs correcting, and I want to know whether anyone has ever written that down.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.000
Everyone writes that down. It's a maintenance record. That's the whole job.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Nobody's ever asked for it.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.500
Because it's lit. That's the whole of it.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:44.500
A light you only put on when you know someone's out there isn't a light. It's a favour.
